{"content":"h14.\n\n**computation site;** `memopayload.RebuildMemoPayload` parses `memo.Content` once through `MarkdownService.ExtractAll`, then stores the derived tags and properties in `memo.Payload` (`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go:74-87`). The extraction walk is implemented in `internal/markdown/markdown.go:355-421`.\n\n**triggers;** recomputation runs when a memo is **created** (`CreateMemo`, `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:70-115`), when an update mask includes **`content`** (`UpdateMemo`, `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:435-451`), and when the payload runner performs its batch rebuild of all memos (`Runner.RunOnce`, `server/runner/memopayload/runner.go:26-72`).\n\n**extracted properties;** the payload receives deduplicated `#tags` (excluding tags inside links/images) and markdown properties: title from the first top-level H1, whether the memo has links, code (block/fenced/inline), a task list, and incomplete tasks (`internal/markdown/markdown.go:376-418`). `ExtractAll` also extracts normalized, deduplicated mentions, but `RebuildMemoPayload` persists only `Tags` and `Property`, not those mentions (`server/runner/memopayload/runner.go:85-86`; `internal/markdown/markdown.go:379-380`).","iteration":12,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
